==Battleground==
*8 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*8 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Saki Matsuga & Doge]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

